==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|mittel}}, from {{inh|de|goh|mittil}} (akin to Old Saxon {{m|osx|middil}}), from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*midilą}}, {{m|gem-pro|*medalą||middle}}, {{m|gem-pro|*midil-}}. Compare Dutch {{m|nl|middel}}, English {{m|en|middle}}. See also {{m|de|Mitte}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmɪtəl/|[ˈmɪtl̩]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Mittel.ogg|audio|lang=de}}

